## 📈 Project Evolution

This project started as a small local ETL exercise.

The longer-term goal is to take the same core pipeline concept and progressively introduce:

```text
Local Python ETL
       ↓
PostgreSQL
       ↓
Cloud Storage
       ↓
Cloud Data Warehouse
       ↓
Orchestration
       ↓
Testing + CI/CD
       ↓
Monitoring + Data Quality
```

This provides a practical path from a simple ETL script toward a more production-oriented data engineering pipeline.

